          "statement": "BINDING. This evidence closes M-01's exploit path AT ANTIMATTER'S ENTRY POINT ONLY. PhusdStableMinter.mint(address,uint256) REMAINS PERMISSIONLESSLY MIS-SCALABLE: the root cause lives in PhusdStableMinter.calculateMintAmount, in a nested dependency, and is reached directly without passing through Antimatter at all. Any proposal to mark a1c81428a47ad295 fixed MUST state this.",
