      "parkedReason": "PARKED VISIBLY, NOT DROPPED (Law 1: recall beats tidiness). PARK RATIONALE CORRECTED 2026-08-18 (review pass) - the original rationale was FACTUALLY WRONG and is superseded. It is NOT true that the phUSD-stable-minter pin is stale: antimatter pins lib/phUSD-stable-minter at d6ed1156, which IS the minter's remote master tip, so THE MINTER PIN IS CURRENT. The stale layer is one level deeper: lib/phUSD-stable-minter/lib/vault is pinned at 043ff2c while vault's remote master is 0110ce4 - 11 commits ahead, including stories 043/044/048/049, which are precisely the commits that introduced deposit() returning creditedPrincipal. What cannot be adjudicated at this commit is therefore WHICH YIELD-STRATEGY / VAULT VERSION IS ACTUALLY DEPLOYED, because this finding depends entirely on the deployed strategy's deposit() return behaviour - not on the minter's version.",
