      "impactInversion_antimatter_02": {
        "statusEffect": "NONE. STATUS REMAINS open. THIS ENTRY IS RE-WORDED, NOT CLOSED - closing it would lose the surviving root cause.",
        "rootCauseUNCHANGED": "The unattributed balance delta at :256 survives the delta BYTE-FOR-BYTE. `mintedForStable` is still Antimatter's own phUSD balance after minus the :244 snapshot, and still attributes to the caller-chosen recipient every wei that arrived in that window regardless of who sent it. The defect is exactly where it was.",
        "impactINVERTED": {
